  "proposed_paragraph": "The author records public disclosure of a candidate in [GitHub PR 152](https://github.com/AlecKriebel/Math/pull/152) on 30 September 2026; GitHub dates the PR's creation to that day. That candidate already contained the cone-index, hyperelliptic-invariance and classical cusp-reduction strategy. Ferudun's Theorem C, [deposited on 9 October 2026](https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23267641), gives the same nontrivial labelled-ratio result by uniform twists and descent. We describe these as contemporaneous separate developments with different proof routes; this does not certify either author's awareness. The physical-chart correction was recorded on 11 October at 23:57 UTC and accepted on 12 October UTC. No first or exclusive priority is claimed."
